{"id":"5755","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5755_main_cirrostratus-fibratus-undulatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>卷层云云纱笼罩天空。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">纤维状</span>表明是毛云种。在图片中间及右上侧，云纱显示出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波纹</span>；这是波状云类。</p>\n<p>在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>可看到凝迹。</p>\n<p>一系列暖锋正快速向东抵近。晚上开始降雨。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Martin Gudd","location":"德国，巴特克罗伊茨纳赫","latitude":"纬度: 49° 50' 39'' N","longitude":"经度: 7° 50' 32'' E","date":"14 November 2015 0909 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 7","code":"图像P/S代码: P.3.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.3.5"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5755_syn_cirrostratus-fibratus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>冷锋及随后的锢囚锋导致德国整夜的不稳定天气。清晨天气晴朗，图为清晨时分冷锋过后的短暂晴空。在大西洋上空，可看到有极明显暖锋的新低压（前热带风暴凯特）正在快速向东抵近。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5755_upper_cirrostratus-fibratus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在西西南方向40公里的探测显示出从632 hPa到195 hPa对流层顶的高水汽含量。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5755_sat_cirrostratus-fibratus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>卫星图片为一系列低压槽过境德国西部时形成的高云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2015","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}